/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   CC TEAM NEW DASHBOARD — LIVE PORTAL BUILD v21 (17-Jul-2026)
   • v4: ALL Lead reads/writes now go through role-gated Server Script APIs
     (cc_get_leads / cc_update_lead / cc_create_lead / cc_get_lead_history)
     so agent roles can be downgraded to SELECT-ONLY on Lead — removes
     "Lead List / Lead Report / New Lead" from the awesomebar while the
     dashboard keeps full lead access. No frappe.client.* calls touch Lead.
   • All static/dummy data removed (agents, sources seed, fallback managers,
     fallback user names, static doctors) — everything now loads live.
   • Add New Lead (portal insert, duplicate check, auto lead-owner respected)
   • Mobile masking + hover reveal (System Manager sees full)
   • Converted client → Financial Summary (Billed / Without GST / GST /
     Paid / Outstanding / Therapy Plans + invoice & payment lists) in both the
